<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Rapid urbanization demands up-to-date geospatial data, yet manual mapping of transportation infrastructure is labor-intensive. This project addresses the challenge of automated road network extraction from high-resolution sattelite imagery. By implementing advanced image processing and feature extraction techniques, the objective is to accurately differentiate road pixels from complex backgrounds and convert them into structured, linear vector layers for seamless GIS integration and urban planning.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
